[CA]
Lease Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and Laura Chalstrom, Beth Chalstrom
and Paul Guyot, d/b/a Putt Hutt, for premises used as a miniature golf course in Lions.  Motion
(per Consent Agenda) carried.  (#5606)
